  "description": "Drowning his post-interview depression in booze, Seowon makes the chaotic decision to sleep with a total stranger. The real nightmare starts the next day when he realizes the hot guy he spent the night with is actually Jaeha—the sweet next-door kid from ten years ago! Seowon begs him to keep quiet, but Jaeha seizes the opportunity. He blackmails Seowon into giving him \"private tutoring\" under the guise of studying for college retakes. As their tutoring sessions quickly turn from academic to intimate, Seowon realizes too late that Jaeha was never interested in passing an exam... his only target was Seowon.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Peanutoon's Hyeong, na Keojyeosseo! Yeokkijap BL Danpyeonseon (형, 나 커졌어! 역키잡 BL 단편선) Collection.*",
